      "content": "its just hard to pause when there’s nothing to hold onto. even when i breathe, the fog feels like it's pushing me closer to the edge. it's not even scary anymore, it’s just... quiet. like the world is finally telling me that the walking is done. it feels right, in a weird way. like the silence is more honest than the struggle was.",
